[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4376197690","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119242#issuecomment-4376197690","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119242","id":4376197690,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBNd6Og","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T02:47:41Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T02:47:41Z","body":"In #118855 we settled on having an explicit requirement stated in the template’s comments, rather than having a heading for it. Maybe the more heavy-handed approach of this PR could be used if the comment based approach of the other PR doesn’t work well in practice.\r\n\r\nOne other thing that was discussed in #118855 was the need to explicitly ask for how AI was used, in addition to requiring it be disclosed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4376197690/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383467311","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119242#issuecomment-4383467311","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119242","id":4383467311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBUZnLw","user":{"login":"skyace65","id":6080368,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODAzNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6080368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65","html_url":"https://github.com/skyace65","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T22:00:04Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T22:00:04Z","body":"> nt stated in the template’s comments, rather than having a heading for it. Maybe the more heavy-handed approach of this PR could be used if the comment based approach of the other PR doesn’t work well in practice.\r\n\r\nI do not think these changes are worth doing without a heavy handed approach, and I'd apply that to the other things your PR lists as well, like what problems are and aren't solved. If someone isn't going to take the time to read the instructions we give them it should be an automatic close. If they're not going to read something that we put right in front of them, why should we be spending time reading and reviewing their PR?\r\n\r\nI also don't see a downside to doing this approach in general.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383467311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383491602","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119242#issuecomment-4383491602","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119242","id":4383491602,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBUbGEg","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T22:05:01Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T10:15:01Z","body":"The main downside to a heavy-handed approach in the template is the risk of alienating contributors. Those not using AI might not appreciate writing \"No\" every time, potentially interpreting this as an unprompted gesture of distrust or virtue signaling. Some might see it as a reminder or invitation to use AI.\r\n\r\nI'm voting to go with Allen's https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118855 first, and if it doesn't work out or the AI situation escalates, we can still reconsider this one.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4383491602/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]